OL,3,AKing makes clear Harry and Meghan
OL,4,Aremain non-working royals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex will not
OL,7,Fbe working royals allowed to carry out
OL,8,Fofficial engagements now they have
OL,9,Freturned to the UK, a letter sent on
OL,10,Fbehalf of King Charles spells out.
OL,12,FThe letter is intended to clarify the
OL,13,Fstatus of Prince Harry and Meghan, who
OL,14,Fmoved back from California with
OL,15,Fchildren Archie and Lilibet last month.
OL,17,FThey will still not be able to use
OL,18,Ftitles of "His and Her Royal Highness",
OL,19,Fand remain "private citizens", says the
OL,20,Fletter sent on behalf of the King by
OL,21,Fthe Lord Chamberlain, a top Palace
OL,22,Fofficial.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
